%%% note
foreach と parallel-foreach: 要素ごとの payload、counter (1 始まり、counterVariableName)、
rootMessage、終了後に payload が元に戻ること、foreach 内の変数変更が外に残ること、counter が
外に残るか、batchSize、collection 省略時 (payload を回す。Object・文字列・null のとき)、
本体のエラーで止まること、入れ子、parallel-foreach の結果の形と順序。
/infer-error: output の無い式で application/java と application/json の値を混ぜると、
出力形式を推論できずに MULE:EXPRESSION になる (foreach とは別件の発見)。
%%% port 18112
%%% request POST /basic
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": ["a", {"b": 2}, 3], "other": true}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "payloadAfter": {
    "items": [
      "a",
      {
        "b": 2
      },
      3
    ],
    "other": true
  },
  "acc": [
    {
      "item": "a",
      "counter": 1,
      "rootIsObject": true
    },
    {
      "item": {
        "b": 2
      },
      "counter": 2,
      "rootIsObject": true
    },
    {
      "item": 3,
      "counter": 3,
      "rootIsObject": true
    }
  ],
  "counterAfter": "absent"
}
%%% request POST /basic
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": []}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "payloadAfter": {
    "items": [
      
    ]
  },
  "acc": [
    
  ],
  "counterAfter": "absent"
}
%%% request POST /batch
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  {
    "batch": [
      1,
      2
    ],
    "i": 1
  },
  {
    "batch": [
      3,
      4
    ],
    "i": 2
  },
  {
    "batch": [
      5
    ],
    "i": 3
  }
]
%%% request POST /shapes
Content-Type: application/json

[1, "two", {"three": 3}]
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "count": 3,
  "acc": [
    1,
    "two",
    {
      "three": 3
    }
  ]
}
%%% request POST /shapes
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": 1, "b": 2}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "count": 2,
  "acc": [
    {
      "a": 1
    },
    {
      "b": 2
    }
  ]
}
%%% request POST /shapes
Content-Type: text/plain

just text
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

"Expecting Array or Object but got String." evaluating expression: "payload".
%%% request GET /shapes
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

"Expecting Array or Object but got Binary." evaluating expression: "payload".
%%% request GET /error
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "seen": [
    1,
    2,
    0
  ],
  "counter": 3,
  "payloadIsElement": 0,
  "errorType": "MULE:EXPRESSION",
  "description": "\"Division by zero\n\n1| 10 / payload\n   ^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTrace:\n  at anonymous::main (line: 1, column: 1)\" evaluating expression: \"10 / payload\"."
}
%%% request POST /infer-error
Content-Type: application/json

[1]
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

"Unable to infer a output media type as more than one is being used: application/java,application/json please specify using: 'output <your mime-type> --- <expr>'

1| vars.acc + payload
   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Trace:
  at anonymous::main (line: 1, column: 1)" evaluating expression: "vars.acc + payload".
%%% request GET /nested
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  "1.1=1",
  "1.2=2",
  "2.1=3"
]
%%% request GET /parallel
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "isArray": true,
  "values": [
    30,
    10,
    20
  ]
}
